# Pre-case working material (new cases in development with an agent) lives
# in casework/ and IS committed while this repository is private (decided
# 2026-08-25, amending the same-day local-only rule) so cloud agents can
# work on new cases. It is working material, never citable, and never
# imported wholesale; see casework/README.md. If this repository ever goes
# public, casework/ must be removed from the tree (and history) first.
